Credits and Acknowledgments

NOCA stands on the shoulders of giants. This project is made possible 
thanks to the following open-source technologies and the dedicated 
communities behind them:

Core Frameworks

- FastAPI
  Author: Sebastián Ramírez (@tiangolo)
  License: MIT
  NOCA utilizes FastAPI for its high-performance asynchronous API and 
  robust type-safety capabilities.

- HTMX
  Author: Big Sky Software (@bigskysoftware)
  License: BSD 2-Clause "Simplified"
  NOCA leverages HTMX to provide a modern, reactive user experience 
  without the overhead of heavy client-side frameworks.

Supporting Ecosystem

- Python Ecosystem: We are grateful to the contributors of SQLAlchemy, 
Pydantic, Uvicorn, and Starlette, which form the backbone of our 
backend services.

- Country Flags SVG
  Author: Hampus Borgos (@hampusborgos)
  License: Unlicense / Public Domain
  NOCA uses this collection of ISO 3166-1 country flag SVGs to display
  national flags throughout the Arena interface.

- The Competitive Programming Community: Special thanks to the creators
of the original BOCA Online Contest Administrator, whose legacy
inspired the development of NOCA.
